  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine cornmeal, salt, and cayenne pepper.",
    "Add water and stir until the mixture forms a thick batter.",
    "Add chopped onion and cilantro, if using.",
    "Heat a non-stick skillet or grill over medium heat.",
    "Using a spoon, drop small balls of the batter onto the skillet or grill.",
    "Flatten the balls slightly with a spatula.",
    "Brush the tops with coconut oil.",
